WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.820
Mind your Decisions, I'm Presh Talwalkar.

00:00:03.759 --> 00:00:08.098
Suppose two lines intersect in the interior of the circle.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.800
If the measure of this arc of the circle is equal to 80°,

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.700
and the measure of this arc of the circle is equal to 140°,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.920
what is the value of ∠X where the two lines intersect?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.980
Pause the video, if you'd like to give this problem a try,

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.300
and when you're ready, keep watching to learn how to solve this problem.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.680
So, how can we solve this problem?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:47.020
The key is constructing a chord of the circle between the two intersecting lines.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.580
Let's see why this helps.

00:00:49.589 --> 00:00:51.589
Consider this 80° arc.

00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:57.018
Notice, between this chord and a line, we've constructed an inscribed angle of the circle.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:03.079
Therefore, the measure of this inscribed angle would be 1/2 of 80°, which is equal to 40°.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:08.569
Similarly, for the other arc, we've constructed an inscribed angle of the circle.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.170
Therefore, the measure of this angle will be equal to 70°.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.999
Putting these two facts together,

00:01:14.999 --> 00:01:19.129
we now consider the two intersecting lines and this constructed triangle.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:22.909
This angle X is an exterior angle of the triangle;

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:28.909
therefore, its value will be equal to 70° + 40°, which is equal to 110°.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.020
Another way of seeing this

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.560
is that the remaining angle in the triangle is equal to 70°, to get a total sum of

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:41.600
180°, and then X = 180° - 70°, which is equal to

00:01:42.149 --> 00:01:44.359
110°, and that's our answer.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.240
Thanks for making Mind your Decisions one of the best channels on YouTube.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:53.800
As always, thanks for watching, and thanks for your support.

